    "step": "Prepare transfer sandwich. Place white side down, place sponge, place a blotting paper, membrane, gel, blotting paper, sponge and close sandwich.\nTry to roll out bubbles after placing the second piece of blotting paper.\nFill the transfer case with transfer buffer, add ice pack &amp; stir bar OR place entire apparatus in ice box to keep transfer apparatus cool. Place sandwich cassettes in apparatus so that black side of cassette faces black side of apparatus. Fill with cool transfer buffer till the top.",
